---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about-section shell" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-panel">
    <SectionHeading id="about-title" label="04 / A little background" title="Curiosity, with a practical side." />
    <div class="about-layout">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>I’m drawn to understanding how things work. Sometimes that means following a problem through an application. Other times it means assembling a PC, improving a network, or getting data safely off a failing drive.</p>
        <p>Independent projects let me explore new ideas in software, AI, and physical systems. I like learning by building, then testing how well the result works in practice.</p>
        <div class="independent-initiative">
          <p class="initiative-label">Independent initiative</p>
          <h3>Valentino Technology Solutions</h3>
          <p>I’m also developing a personal technology-services venture and am open to independent technical work.</p>
          <a class="quiet-link" href="https://valentinotechsolutions.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit the services website <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="education" aria-labelledby="education-title">
        <h3 id="education-title">Education & perspective</h3>
        <article class="education-entry">
          <p class="education-kind">Computer science</p>
          <h4>Aurora University</h4>
          <p>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</p>
          <p class="education-note">GPA: 3.88/4.0</p>
          <p class="transfer-note">Earlier study at College of DuPage before transferring to Aurora.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="education-entry">
          <p class="education-kind">International Studies</p>
          <h4>International College of Seville (ICS)</h4>
          <p class="education-note">Seville, Spain</p>
          <p>Spanish Language & Culture</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section { padding-bottom: var(--section-space); }
  .about-panel { padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: 1rem; background: var(--color-canvas-soft); }
  .about-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr); gap: 2.5rem clamp(2rem, 6vw, 6rem); }
  .about-copy > p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-soft); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .about-copy > p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .independent-initiative { margin-top: 1.75rem; padding-top: 1.35rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); }
  .initiative-label { color: var(--color-accent-soft); font-size: 0.72rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .independent-initiative h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .independent-initiative > p:not(.initiative-label) { margin: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .independent-initiative a { font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .education h3 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .education-entry { border-left: 2px solid var(--color-rule-strong); padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .education-entry + .education-entry { margin-top: 1.75rem; }
  .education-kind { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; color: var(--color-accent-soft); font-size: 0.72rem; }
  h4 { margin: 0 0 0.35rem; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .education-entry > p:not(.education-kind) { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; color: var(--color-text-soft); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .education-entry > p.education-note, .education-entry > p.transfer-note { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; }
  .education-entry > p.transfer-note { margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) { .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .education { padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); } }
</style>
